    <h1 class="msv-hero__title">Registering a Car in Spain as a Foreigner: What You Need to Do</h1>
    <p class="msv-hero__intro">If you're moving to Spain long-term, your foreign-registered car situation needs addressing. Rules around how long you can drive a foreign-plated car in Spain as a resident, and the process for transferring or buying a Spanish-registered vehicle, catch many expats off guard. Here's what you need to know.</p>
  </div>
